/parent/child command param1 param2 p3 p4
------------- ------- -------------------
     |           |         |  
     |           *- Command|single word token
     *- Path section       |
                           *- params section

/parent child command p1 p2 p3 p4
  |
  |*- Transform input line
  |
/parent/child/command/p1/p2/p3/p4

*-------------*
* Match types *
*-------------*

Complete match
==============
Input: /settings/user print all
Command: /settings/user/print[all]
Response: MatchResult::Command((fn(&str)->Result<String,String>, &str))
/settings/user/print/all  | This is a complete match
/settings/user/print      | Params and command function returned

Command partial match
=====================
Input: /settings/user pri
Command: /settings/user/print[all]
Response: MatchResult::CommandSuggestion("/settings/user/print")
/settings/user/pri        | This is a partial match
/settings/user/print      | /full path is returnd as CommandSuggestion

Path match
=====================
Input: /settings/user
Command: /settings/user/print[all]
Response: MatchResult::Path("/settings/user")
/settings/user            | This is a complete path match
/settings/user/print      | path returned as path match

Path partial match
=====================
Input: /settings/us
Command: /settings/user/print[all]
Response: MatchResult::PathSuggestion("/settings/user")
/settings/user/pri        | This is a partial path match
/settings/user/print      | parent path returnd as path suggestion